        <mxCell id="13" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#6B21A8;strokeWidth=1.8;fontColor=#0F172A;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;shadow=1;arcSize=6;" value="&lt;b&gt;item_extra_executions&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10px;opacity:0.9;&quot;&gt;PK: ORDER#&amp;lt;id&amp;gt; | SK: EXTRA_EXEC#&amp;lt;ts&amp;gt;#&amp;lt;id&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;hr style=&quot;margin:4px 0;&quot;/&gt;&lt;table style=&quot;width:100%;font-size:10px;border-collapse:collapse;&quot;&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 6px;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;[PK] PK&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 6px;color:#475569;text-align:right;&quot;&gt;ORDER#&amp;lt;service_order_id&amp;gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 6px;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;[SK] SK&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 6px;color:#475569;text-align:right;&quot;&gt;EXTRA_EXEC#&amp;lt;ts&amp;gt;#&amp;lt;extraId&amp;gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 6px;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;extra_execution_id&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 6px;color:#475569;text-align:right;&quot;&gt;S (UUID)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 6px;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;status&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 6px;color:#475569;text-align:right;&quot;&gt;S (WAITING_APPROVAL|APPROVED|REFUSED)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 6px;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;total_extra_price&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 6px;color:#475569;text-align:right;&quot;&gt;N (Double)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 6px;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;[BOOL] extra_services_accepted&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 6px;color:#475569;text-align:right;&quot;&gt;BOOL?&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 6px;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;[L&amp;lt;M&amp;gt;] executions&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 6px;color:#475569;text-align:right;&quot;&gt;List&amp;lt;ExecutionDynamoItem&amp;gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;" vertex="1"><mxGeometry height="231" width="425" x="1170" y="525" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="14" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#92400E;strokeWidth=1.8;fontColor=#0F172A;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;shadow=1;arcSize=6;" value="&lt;b&gt;item_service_order_history&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10px;opacity:0.9;&quot;&gt;PK: ORDER#&amp;lt;id&amp;gt; | SK: HIST#&amp;lt;ts&amp;gt;#&amp;lt;id&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;hr style=&quot;margin:4px 0;&quot;/&gt;&lt;table style=&quot;width:100%;font-size:10px;border-collapse:collapse;&quot;&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 6px;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;[PK] PK&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 6px;color:#475569;text-align:right;&quot;&gt;ORDER#&amp;lt;service_order_id&amp;gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 6px;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;[SK] SK&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 6px;color:#475569;text-align:right;&quot;&gt;HIST#&amp;lt;ts&amp;gt;#&amp;lt;historyId&amp;gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 6px;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;history_id / status&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 6px;color:#475569;text-align:right;&quot;&gt;S&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 6px;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;register_time / interval_time&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 6px;color:#475569;text-align:right;&quot;&gt;S / N&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 6px;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;description / payment_status&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 6px;color:#475569;text-align:right;&quot;&gt;S&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;" vertex="1"><mxGeometry height="181" width="425" x="705" y="575" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="15" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#5EEAD4;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#1E293B;fontSize=10.5;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=10;shadow=1;arcSize=6;" value="&lt;b&gt;⚙️ Single-Table &amp;amp; Filas SQS no Contexto de Execução (service-order-execution-service)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;• Partição Atômica: Query PK = &amp;quot;ORDER#&amp;lt;id&amp;gt;&amp;quot; traz cabeçalho + tarefas + insumos + lotes extras + auditoria.&lt;br/&gt;• GSI [pending-dispatch-index]: scheduler_os_ready_for_payment (30m) consulta status PENDING para cobrança.&lt;br/&gt;• Filas Produzidas: approve-notification-queue (orçamento) e os-ready-for-payment-queue (cobrança).&lt;br/&gt;• Filas Consumidas: callback-approve-notification-queue (aprovação) e payment-success-queue (liquidação PAID).&lt;br/&gt;• Substitui na Fase 4: tb_service_order, tb_service_order_history, tb_execution, tb_execution_history,&lt;br/&gt;  tb_execution_insume e tb_insume sem dependência de joins distribuídos." vertex="1"><mxGeometry height="300" width="890" x="705" y="795" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="16" parent="1" style="shape=umlFrame;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;width=490;height=28;boundedLbl=1;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=10;fillColor=#EFF6FF;strokeColor=#1D4ED8;strokeWidth=1.6;fontColor=#1E3A8A;fontSize=11;" value="&lt;b&gt;CONTEXTO 3: PAYMENT-SERVICE (DYNAMODB tb-payment)&lt;/b&gt;" vertex="1"><mxGeometry height="1015" width="695" x="1725" y="108" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="17" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#1E40AF;strokeWidth=1.8;fontColor=#0F172A;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;shadow=1;arcSize=6;" value="&lt;b&gt;item_payment&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10px;opacity:0.9;&quot;&gt;PK: BILLING#&amp;lt;order_id&amp;gt; | SK: PAY#&amp;lt;ts&amp;gt;#&amp;lt;payment_id&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;hr style=&quot;margin:4px 0;&quot;/&gt;&lt;table style=&quot;width:100%;font-size:10px;border-collapse:collapse;&quot;&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 6px;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;[PK] PK&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 6px;color:#475569;text-align:right;&quot;&gt;BILLING#&amp;lt;service_order_id&amp;gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 6px;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;[SK] SK&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 6px;color:#475569;text-align:right;&quot;&gt;PAY#&amp;lt;ts&amp;gt;#&amp;lt;payment_id&amp;gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 6px;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;payment_id / service_order_id / customer_id&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 6px;color:#475569;text-align:right;&quot;&gt;S&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 6px;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;price_value&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 6px;color:#475569;text-align:right;&quot;&gt;N (Double)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 6px;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;[GSI-SK] payment_date&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 6px;color:#475569;text-align:right;&quot;&gt;S (ISO-8601)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 6px;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;status&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 6px;color:#475569;text-align:right;&quot;&gt;S (PENDING|APPROVED|REFUSED|REFUNDED)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 6px;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;payment_method&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 6px;color:#475569;text-align:right;&quot;&gt;S (MERCADO_PAGO_QR|CONTINGENCY|PIX)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 6px;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;os_update_status / payment_info&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 6px;color:#475569;text-align:right;&quot;&gt;S (BR Code PIX)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 6px;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;[GSI-PK] dispatch_notificate_status&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 6px;color:#475569;text-align:right;&quot;&gt;S (dispatch-notification-index)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 6px;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;origin_trace_id / refund_reason / refund_date&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 6px;color:#475569;text-align:right;&quot;&gt;S?&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;" vertex="1"><mxGeometry height="306" width="645" x="1750" y="190" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="18" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#3730A3;strokeWidth=1.8;fontColor=#0F172A;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;shadow=1;arcSize=6;" value="&lt;b&gt;item_invoice&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10px;opacity:0.9;&quot;&gt;PK: BILLING#&amp;lt;order_id&amp;gt; | SK: INV#&amp;lt;ts&amp;gt;#&amp;lt;invoice_id&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;hr style=&quot;margin:4px 0;&quot;/&gt;&lt;table style=&quot;width:100%;font-size:10px;border-collapse:collapse;&quot;&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 6px;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;[PK] PK&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 6px;color:#475569;text-align:right;&quot;&gt;BILLING#&amp;lt;service_order_id&amp;gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 6px;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;[SK] SK&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 6px;color:#475569;text-align:right;&quot;&gt;INV#&amp;lt;ts&amp;gt;#&amp;lt;invoice_id&amp;gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 6px;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;invoice_id / invoice_number&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 6px;color:#475569;text-align:right;&quot;&gt;S&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 6px;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;service_order_id / customer_id&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 6px;color:#475569;text-align:right;&quot;&gt;S (UUID)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 6px;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;price_value / emission_date&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 6px;color:#475569;text-align:right;&quot;&gt;N / S&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 6px;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;invoice_info / client_dispatch&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 6px;color:#475569;text-align:right;&quot;&gt;S&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;" vertex="1"><mxGeometry height="206" width="645" x="1750" y="525" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="19" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#93C5FD;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#1E293B;fontSize=10.5;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=10;shadow=1;arcSize=6;" value="&lt;b&gt;🔔 Integração Mercado Pago CB + notification-service (Stateless)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;• GSI [dispatch-notification-index]: scheduler_os_payment_atualization (15m)&lt;br/&gt;  garante consistência eventual entre DynamoDB e SQS.&lt;br/&gt;• Circuit Breaker Resilience4j: contingência PIX local (FALLBACK-MP-*).&lt;br/&gt;• Compensação: /refund preenche refund_reason + refund_date.&lt;br/&gt;• notification-service (EKS): microsserviço STATELESS (sem banco próprio);&lt;br/&gt;  consome approve-notification-queue e payment-notification-queue e envia SMTP." vertex="1"><mxGeometry height="300" width="645" x="1750" y="795" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="20" edge="1" parent="1" style="html=1;startArrow=none;endArrow=block;rounded=0;edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;strokeColor=#15803D;fontColor=#15803D;fontSize=10;strokeWidth=1.6;dashed=1;" value="REST UUIDs: customer_id + vehicle_id"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="452.5" y="162" /><mxPoint x="917.5" y="162" /></Array><mxPoint x="452.5" y="190" as="sourcePoint" /><mxPoint x="917.5" y="190" as="targetPoint" /></mxGeometry></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="21" edge="1" parent="1" style="html=1;startArrow=none;endArrow=block;rounded=0;edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;strokeColor=#0F766E;fontColor=#0F766E;fontSize=10;strokeWidth=1.6;dashed=1;" value="SQS: os-ready-for-payment&#10;(service_order_id, price)"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="1148" y="427.5" /><mxPoint x="1148" y="448" /><mxPoint x="1672" y="448" /><mxPoint x="1672" y="252.5" /></Array><mxPoint x="1130" y="427.5" as="sourcePoint" /><mxPoint x="1750" y="252.5" as="targetPoint" /></mxGeometry></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="22" edge="1" parent="1" style="html=1;startArrow=none;endArrow=block;rounded=0;edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;strokeColor=#1D4ED8;fontColor=#1D4ED8;fontSize=10;strokeWidth=1.6;dashed=1;" value="SQS: payment-success&#10;➔ OS status = PAID"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="1672" y="452.5" /><mxPoint x="1672" y="492" /><mxPoint x="1148" y="492" /><mxPoint x="1148" y="402.5" /></Array><mxPoint x="1750" y="452.5" as="sourcePoint" /><mxPoint x="1130" y="402.5" as="targetPoint" /></mxGeometry></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="23" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeColor=#94A3B8;fontColor=#1E293B;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=12;shadow=1;arcSize=6;" value="&lt;b&gt;🏛️ EVOLUÇÃO COMPLETA DO MODELO DE DADOS: FASE 3 (MONÓLITO SQL) ➔ FASE 4 (PERSISTÊNCIA POLIGLOTA DATABASE-PER-SERVICE)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&amp;bull; &lt;b&gt;Fase 3 — Modelo Relacional Único (docs/delivery/infrastructure/fase_3/database-er-diagram.png):&lt;/b&gt; • Banco único Amazon RDS PostgreSQL concentrando 10 tabelas interligadas por FKs físicas (tb_user, tb_customer, tb_vehicle, tb_service_order, tb_service_order_history,   tb_execution, tb_execution_history, tb_execution_insume, tb_insume e tb_invoice), gerando acoplamento transacional em um único esquema monolítico.&lt;br/&gt;&amp;bull; &lt;b&gt;Fase 4 — Modelo Poliglota Distribuído (ADR-014 + ADR-015 + ADR-016 + ADR-019):&lt;/b&gt; • SQL Relacional + Cache (register-service): RDS PostgreSQL 16 (tb_user, tb_customer, tb_vehicle) + ElastiCache Redis 7.0 (user-login-cache :6379), sem tb_insume. • NoSQL Single-Table #1 (service-order-execution-service): DynamoDB tb-service_order (PK ORDER#&amp;lt;id&amp;gt;, SKs METADATA / EXEC# / EXTRA_EXEC# / HIST#) + List&amp;lt;Insumes&amp;gt; embutido. • NoSQL Single-Table #2 (payment-service): DynamoDB tb-payment (PK BILLING#&amp;lt;id&amp;gt;, SKs PAY# / INV#) com estornos Saga, Circuit Breaker Mercado Pago e GSIs dedicados. • Serviço Stateless (notification-service): Sem banco de dados dedicado; opera puramente orientado a eventos SQS e callbacks HTTP REST." vertex="1"><mxGeometry height="260" width="2380" x="40" y="1148" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
</mxfile>
